abstract: >-
  LinguaX Arc is a fully offline corpus analysis toolkit for Android. It
  provides KWIC concordancing, concordance plots, a file viewer, collocation
  (MI, T-score, log-likelihood, Dice) and cluster analysis, n-grams, word lists,
  keyness analysis against a reference corpus (log-likelihood, chi-square, Log
  Ratio, %DIFF), a corpus overview with a rule-based word-class profile and a
  punctuation profile, word clouds, extractive summarisation and lexicon-based
  sentiment analysis. All processing runs on the device, requiring no internet
  connection and transmitting no data, which makes it suitable for fieldwork,
  low-connectivity settings, and sensitive corpora that cannot be uploaded to
  third-party servers.
